     0.20    10000    12.8     8.4    16.7     28.9     11.3s      1.9s        29.5     12.5s      2.0s
     0.30    10000    12.8    10.2    15.6     31.6     16.2s      2.6s        32.4     17.8s      2.9s
     0.50    10000    12.8    13.2    13.2     36.3     24.8s      4.1s        37.6     27.1s      4.4s
     0.80    10000    12.8    16.7     8.4     42.4     35.9s      5.9s        44.2     39.1s      6.4s
